      "text": "#RESCUE Marine Interdiction Agents from the Fajardo Marine Unit sprang into action Thursday, after a distress call of a sinking boat near Ceiba, Puerto Rico! Thanks to their incredible teamwork and swift response, the agents  completed a emergency tow and were able to safely beach the sinking vessel on a local boat ramp. The captain and passenger were evaluated by Marine Interdiction Agents certified as Emergency Medical Technicians. They determined that the pair were in good health and no further medical attention was needed.  #SearchandRescue #SavingLives",
